d S. Weisman, DO, FACP</a></div></div><div class="article-meta-mobile-group"><div class="meta-pubdate" data-article-meta="article-meta-array">Apr 8, 2025</div></div><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--></div><div class="article-meta-tablet"><div class="meta-author" data-article-meta="article-meta-array"><div class="meta-author-avatar"></div><div class="meta-author-names xs:block md:hidden" data-expanded="false"><a href="?show-author=true&amp;author-id=AU3690">David S. Weisman, DO, FACP</a></div><div class="xs:hidden md:block"><a href="?show-author=true&amp;author-id=AU3690">David S. Weisman, DO, FACP</a></div></div><div class="article-meta-tablet-group"><div class="meta-pubdate" data-article-meta="article-meta-array">April 8, 2025</div></div><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--></div><div class="article-meta-desktop"><div class="meta-author" data-article-meta="article-meta-array"><div class="meta-author-avatar"></div><div class="meta-author-names xs:block md:hidden" data-expanded="false"><a href="?show-author=true&amp;author-id=AU3690">David S. Weisman, DO, FACP</a></div><div class="xs:hidden md:block"><a href="?show-author=true&amp;author-id=AU3690">David S. Weisman, DO, FACP</a></div></div><div class="meta-pubdate" data-article-meta="article-meta-array">April 8, 2025</div><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--></div></div></div><div class="col-span-12"><div class="dividers-container"><div class="divider-elements-container"><div></div><div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="article-with-right-rail-container"><div class="article-section-container"><section class="article-section"><template id="P:3"></template><div class="nejm-topic-container blur-unauthorized-content" data-location="recirc_topics_article"><h6>Topics</h6><div class="nejm-topic-array"><a title="Browse Clinical Medicine articles" href="/browse/specialty/clinical-medicine"><button class="relative secondary-filled-button-text-large badge" type="button"><span>Clinical Medicine</span></button></a><a title="Browse Clinical Medicine General articles" href="/browse/topic/clinical-medicine-general"><button class="relative secondary-filled-button-text-large badge" type="button"><span>Clinical Medicine General</span></button></a><a title="Browse Ambulatory Medicine articles" href="/browse/topic/ambulatory-medicine"><button class="relative secondary-filled-button-text-large badge" type="button"><span>Ambulatory Medicine</span></button></a><a title="Browse Endocrinology articles" href="/browse/specialty/endocrinology"><button class="relative secondary-filled-button-text-large badge" type="button"><span>Endocrinology</span></button></a><a title="Browse Obesity articles" href="/browse/topic/obesity"><button class="relative secondary-filled-button-text-large badge" type="button"><span>Obesity</span></button></a></div></div></section></div><!--$!--><template data-dgst="BAILOUT_TO_CLIENT_SIDE_RENDERING"></template><!--/$--></div></div><div class="fixed inset-x-0 bottom-0"></div></div><script>$RS=function(a,b){a=document.getElementById(a);b=document.getElementById(b);for(a.parentNode.removeChild(a);a.firstChild;)b.parentNode.insertBefore(a.firstChild,b);b.parentNode.removeChild(b)};$RS("S:2","P:2")</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"69:T1d24,"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"%7B%22author%22%3A%5B%7B%22contrib_id%22%3A%22AU3690%22%2C%22contrib_type%22%3A%22author%22%2C%22id%22%3A277%2C%22status%22%3A%22published%22%2C%22sort%22%3Anull%2C%22user_created%22%3A%229c191d5d-4c8a-44f4-8be4-ca15d2ce86f4%22%2C%22date_created%22%3A%222025-09-17T02%3A51%3A23.385Z%22%2C%22user_updated%22%3A%22a4e71e7a-b3f8-4fc9-b9b5-91ac8de1eaac%22%2C%22date_updated%22%3A%222026-02-04T17%3A50%3A22.914Z%22%2C%22author_id%22%3A%22AU3690%22%2C%22display_name%22%3A%22David%20S.%20Weisman%2C%20D.O.%2C%20F.A.C.P.%22%2C%22first_name%22%3A%22David%22%2C%22last_name%22%3A%22Weisman%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22Associate%20Editor%22%2C%22bio_information%22%3A%22%3Cp%20class%3D%5C%22MsoNormal%5C%22%3EDr.%20Dave%20Weisman%20is%20an%20Associate%20Professor%20of%20Medicine%20at%20Georgetown%20University%20School%20of%20Medicine%20and%20an%20Associate%20Program%20Director%20in%20Internal%20Medicine%20at%20MedStar%20Health%20in%20Baltimore%2C%20MD.%20He%20graduated%20from%20the%20Chicago%20College%20of%20Osteopathic%20Medicine%20and%20completed%20his%20residency%20at%20the%20University%20of%20Illinois%20at%20Chicago%2C%20where%20he%20served%20as%20chief%20resident.%20He%20is%20the%20Vice%20Chair%20of%20Medicine%20for%20Quality%20at%20MedStar%20Union%20and%20Good%20Samaritan%20Hospitals%2C%20overseeing%20an%20interdisciplinary%20mortality%20committee%20and%20peer%20review%20and%20moderating%20Grand%20Rounds.%20His%20interests%20include%20training%20students%20and%20residents%20in%20evidence-based%20medicine%20and%20point-of-care%20ultrasound%2C%20and%20he%20values%20the%20challenges%20and%20rewards%20of%20primary%20care.%3C%2Fp%3E%5Cn%3Cp%3EDr.%20Weisman%20has%20nothing%20to%20disclose.%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22disclosures%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22notes%22%3A%22%22%2C%22specialities%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22editorial_policies%22%3Anull%2C%22author_image%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22c8b223dc-94a6-44d0-aa34-9c40ce36e898%22%2C%22storage%22%3A%22s3store%22%2C%22filename_disk%22%3A%22c8b223dc-94a6-44d0-aa34-9c40ce36e898.jpg%22%2C%22filename_download%22%3A%22c8b223dc-94a6-44d0-aa34-9c40ce36e898.jpg%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22A%20U3690%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22image%2Fjpeg%22%2C%22uploaded_on%22%3A%222025-09-03T20%3A25%3A50.476Z%22%2C%22modified_on%22%3A%222025-09-03T20%3A25%3A50.562Z%22%2C%22charset%22%3Anull%2C%22filesize%22%3A%2241236%22%2C%22width%22%3A280%2C%22height%22%3A280%2C%22duration%22%3Anull%2C%22embed%22%3Anull%2C%22description%22%3Anull%2C%22location%22%3Anull%2C%22tags%22%3Anull%2C%22metadata%22%3A%7B%7D%2C%22focal_point_x%22%3Anull%2C%22focal_point_y%22%3Anull%2C%22folder%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%2285877833-a5d8-42b3-b8a2-d22b78567b3d%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22Authors%22%2C%22parent%22%3Anull%7D%2C%22uploaded_by%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%2266b33c91-fc12-4528-b3a3-3ca94e4e8f12%22%2C%22first_name%22%3A%22Admin%22%2C%22last_name%22%3A%22User%22%2C%22email%22%3A%22sre%40mms.org%22%2C%22password%22%3A%22**********%22%2C%22location%22%3Anull%2C%22title%22%3Anull%2C%22description%22%3Anull%2C%22tags%22%3Anull%2C%22avatar%22%3Anull%2C%22language%22%3Anull%2C%22tfa_secret%22%3Anull%2C%22status%22%3A%22active%22%2C%22role%22%3A%223b7bcb23-5ab5-4899-bdd6-a6868040b2f7%22%2C%22token%22%3A%22**********%22%2C%22last_access%22%3A%222026-08-17T19%3A44%3A58.576Z%22%2C%22last_page%22%3A%22%2Fcontent%2Fauthors%22%2C%22provider%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22external_identifier%22%3Anull%2C%22auth_data%22%3Anull%2C%22email_notifications%22%3Atrue%2C%22appearance%22%3Anull%2C%22theme_dark%22%3Anull%2C%22theme_light%22%3Anull%2C%22theme_light_overrides%22%3Anull%2C%22theme_dark_overrides%22%3Anull%7D%2C%22modified_by%22%3Anull%7D%7D%5D%2C%22authorized%22%3Afalse%2C%22pageContent%22%3A%7B%22abstract%22%3A%22In%20a%20small%20trial%2C%20a%204%3A3%20intermittent-fasting%20diet%20resulted%20in%20significantly%20more%20weight%20loss%20than%20did%20daily%20calorie%20restriction.%22%2C%22articleBody%22%3A%22%3Cdiv%20id%3D%5C%2210.1056%2Fnejm-jw.NA58641-body%5C%22%20class%3D%5C%22onepub-jats-body%5C%22%3E%3Cdiv%20class%3D%5C%22onepub-jats-section-container%5C%22%3E%3Cp%3EIntermittent%20fasting%2C%20which%20includes%20time-restricted%20eating%20or%20fasting%20on%20specific%20days%20of%20the%20week%2C%20is%20a%20popular%20weight-loss%20strategy%20that%20might%20improve%20adherence%20compared%20with%20daily%20caloric%20restriction.%20However%2C%20four%20previous%20head-to-head%20trials%20have%20not%20shown%20significant%20weight%20loss%20with%20intermittent%20fasting%20(2%20fasting%20days%20weekly)%20compared%20with%20daily%20calorie%20restriction.%3C%2Fp%3E%3Cp%3EIn%20a%20new%20study%2C%20U.S.%20researchers%20randomized%20165%20adults%20to%20a%204%3A3%20intermittent-fasting%20diet%20(i.e.%2C%2080%25%20calorie%20reduction%20on%203%20days%20weekly%2C%20and%20no%20restrictions%20on%20other%20days)%20or%20a%20traditional%20caloric-restriction%20diet%20(i.e.%2C%2034%25%20reduction%20in%20calories%20daily).%20Three%20quarters%20of%20participants%20were%20women%2C%20mean%20baseline%20body-mass%20index%20(BMI)%20was%2034%20kg%2Fm%3Csup%3E2%3C%2Fsup%3E%2C%20and%20mean%20weight%20was%2097%20kg%E2%80%A6%3C%2Fp%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%3C%2Fdiv%3E%22%2C%22articleCategory%22%3A%5B%7B%22label%22%3A%22Stay%20Informed%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22stay-informed%22%2C%22semanticCode%22%3A%22stay-informed%22%2C%22alias1%22%3Anull%2C%22alias2%22%3Anull%7D%5D%2C%22articleMedia%22%3Anull%2C%22articleTitle%22%3A%22Intermittent%20Fasting%20or%20Daily%20Caloric%20Restriction%20for%20Weight%20Loss%3F%22%2C%22articleType%22%3A%5B%7B%22label%22%3A%22journal%20watch%22%2C%22value%22%3A%22Journal%20Watch%22%2C%22semanticCode%22%3A%22journal-watch%22%2C%22alias1%22%3Anull%2C%22alias2%22%3Anull%7D%5D%2C%22author%22%3A%5B%7B%22bio%22%3A%7B%22disclosures%22%3A%5B%5B%7B%22publication%22%3A%22%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22Nothing%20to%20disclose%22%7D%5D%5D%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%7D%2C%22contrib_id%22%3A%22AU3690%22%2C%22contrib_type%22%3A%22author%22%2C%22degrees%22%3A%5B%22DO%2C%20FACP%22%5D%2C%22name%22%3A%7B%22given-names%22%3A%5B%22David%20S.%22%5D%2C%22surname%22%3A%5B%22Weisman%22%5D%7D%7D%5D%2C%22customMetaGroup%22%3A%5B%7B%22name%22%3A%5B%22Editor's%20Pick%22%5D%2C%22value%22%3A%5B%22no%22%5D%7D%5D%2C%22doi%22%3A%2210.1056%2Fnejm-jw.NA58641%22%2C%22epub%22%3A%222025-04-08%22%2C%22journalId%22%3A%22%22%2C%22journalTitle%22%3A%22NEJM%20Journal%20Watch%22%2C%22mmsSpecialty%22%3A%5B%22mms-specialty%20N%2FA%22%5D%2C%22nejmTopics%22%3A%5B%7B%22code%22%3A%2228%22%2C%22keyword%22%3A%22Clinical%20Medicine%22%2C%22slug%22%3A%22clinical-medicine%22%7D%2C%7B%22code%22%3A%2228_1%22%2C%22keyword%22%3A%22Clinical%20Medicine%20General%22%2C%22slug%22%3A%22clinical-medicine-general%22%7D%2C%7B%22code%22%3A%2228_3%22%2C%22keyword%22%3A%22Ambulatory%20Medicine%22%2C%22slug%22%3A%22ambulatory-medicine%22%7D%2C%7B%22code%22%3A%226%22%2C%22keyword%22%3A%22Endocrinology%22%2C%22slug%22%3A%22endocrinology%22%7D%2C%7B%22code%22%3A%226_5%22%2C%22keyword%22%3A%22Obesity%22%2C%22slug%22%3A%22obesity%22%7D%5D%2C%22pngArticleClass%22%3A%5B%22Clinician%22%5D%2C%22ppub%22%3A%222025-04-08%22%2C%22pubDate%22%3A%222025-04-08%22%2C%22publisherId%22%3A%22NA58641%22%2C%22publisherName%22%3A%22Massachusetts%20Medical%20Society%22%2C%22relatedArticle%22%3A%22%22%2C%22relatedContent%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22relatedObject%22%3A%22%22%2C%22relatedSubArticles%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22source%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22status%22%3A%22Restricted%22%2C%22url%22%3A%22intermittent-fasting-daily-caloric-restriction-weight-loss-nejm-jw.NA58641%22%7D%7D"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"68:[\"$\",\"$L5d\",null,{\"child\":\"ArticleBody\",\"encoded\":\"$69\"}]\n66:null\n"])</script><div hidden id="S:3"><div class="article-content blur-unauthorized-content paywall-content"><div class="article-abstract">In a small trial, a 4:3 intermittent-fasting diet resulted in significantly more weight loss than did daily calorie restriction.</div><div class="onepub-jats-body"><p>Intermittent fasting, which includes time-restricted eating or fasting on specific days of the week, is a popular weight-loss strategy that might improve adherence compared with daily caloric restriction. However, four previous head-to-head trials have not shown significant weight loss with intermittent fasting (2 fasting days weekly) compared with daily calorie restriction.</p><p>In a new study, U.S. researchers randomized 165 adults to a 4:3 intermittent-fasting diet (i.e., 80% calorie reduction on 3 days weekly, and no restrictions on other days) or a traditional caloric-restriction diet (i.e., 34% reduction in calories daily). Three quarters of participants were women, mean baseline body-mass index (BMI) was 34 kg/m<sup>2</sup>, and mean weight was 97 kg…</p><div class="article-author-container" data-location="reviewing_author"><h6>Reviewing <!-- -->Author</h6><div><div class="article-author  max-op-tablet-min:!hidden"><div class="article-author-avatar"></div><div class="article-author-meta"><div class="article-author-name-and-title"><a href="?show-author=true&amp;author-id=AU3690">David S. Weisman, DO, FACP</a></div><div class="article-author-disclosures-container"><span class="label-legal">Disclosures</span><div class="article-author-single-disclosure"><span class="disclosure-title">Nothing to disclose</span><span class="disclosure-publication"></span></div></div></div></div><div class="article-author no-disclosures-or-mobile flex-start op-tablet-min:!hidden flex-col"><div class="article-author-mobile-avatar-and-name"><div class="article-author-avatar"></div><div class="article-author-meta"><div class="article-author-name-and-title"><a href="?show-author=true&amp;author-id=AU3690">David S. Weisman, DO, FACP</a></div></div></div><div class="article-author-disclosures-container"><span class="label-legal">Disclosures</span><div class="article-author-single-disclosure"><span class="disclosure-title">Nothing to disclose</span><span class="disclosure-publication"></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><script>$RS("S:3","P:3")</script><script>$RC("B:1","S:1")</script></body></html>